; Workflow W05 (docs/product/workflows.md): open a partner's drawing, read its preservation report
; (returned by OPEN), move the whole plan, change the layer of one wall, and give the drawing back as
; DXF. Placeholders are filled by the test: the partner drawing and the output file. The window takes
; every entity of the plan, and the layer change picks the right wall, which is drawn last there.

OPEN path="{partner}"
MOVE
W -1000,-1000 5000,4000
0,0
1000,500
CHPROP layer=PLAN
5000,2000
SAVE path="{output}"
